							<table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr><td class="ContentBoxBody"><table class="ContentBox" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="ContentBoxBody"> <div align="center"><font color="#0000ff"><b>Magician Epic</b></font><br /> </div> Token of Mastery</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lake Rathetear - Go talk to Rykas Say 'I wish to learn the tale of Magi'kot'. Receive the Token of Mastery. <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Magi'kot 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">West Commonlands – Find Jahsohn Aksot and turn in Token of Mastery for experience and storyline. <hr id="null" /> </td></tr></tbody></table> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Magi’kot 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Kithicor Forest - Kill Dread Wolves till a Torn Page of Magi'kot 1 drops</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><br /> <hr id="null" /> <br />Words of Magi’kot 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Estate of Unrest – Kill Tentacle Terrors till a Torn Page of Magi'kot 2 drops</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Magi’kot 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lower Guk – Kill Bloodthirsty Ghouls till a Torn Page of Magi'kot 3 drops</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Magi’kot 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">West Commonlands – Return to Jahsohn Aksot and turn in Torn pages of Magi’kot 1, 2 and 3. Receive Words of Magi'kot</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Power of the Elements 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Mistmoore – Kill Gypsy Dancers till you get: Power of Wind</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Power of the Elements 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lesser Faydark – Kill Fairy Guards till you get: Power of Earth</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Power of the Elements 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Solusek’s Eye – Kill Blazing and Lava Elementals till you get: Power of Fire</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Power of the Elements 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Kaesora – Kill Famished and Enraged Raveners till you get: Power of Water</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Power of the Elements 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Butcherblock Mountains – Seek out Walnan (not a common spawn, so be patient) Turn in Power of Wind, Earth, Fire, and Water. Receive Power of the Elements</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Mastery 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Najena or Cazic Thule – kill Magicians or Alligators and loot a Torn Page of Mastery: Water</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Mastery 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Najena or Cazic Thule – kill Magicians or Alligators and loot a Torn Page of Mastery: Earth</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Mastery 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Najena or Cazic Thule – kill Magicians or Alligators and loot a Torn Page of Mastery: Air</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Mastery 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Najena or Cazic Thule – kill Magicians or Alligators and loot a Torn Page of Mastery: Fire</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Words of Mastery 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Najena – Find Akksstaff (He is a wandering NPC, so he could be anywhere) Turn in all torn pages Receive Words of Mastery</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Power of the Orb</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lake Rathe - Turn in: Words of Magi'kot, Power of the Elements, and Words of Mastery in to Rykas. Receive Power of the Orb.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Fire 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">City of Mist – Kill Neh’Asshirr and loot Torch of the Elements</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Fire 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Burning Woods – kill Named Wurms and loot Burning Embers</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Fire 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Kedge Keep – Kill Undertow and loot Blazing Wand</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Fire 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Skyfire Mountains – Find Jennus Lyklobar (western wall, not always spawned) and turn in the Torch of the Elements, Burning Embers, Blazing Wand, and Power of the Orb to Receive Element of Fire.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Earth 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Plane of Hate – Kill Magi P’tasa and loot Staff of Elemental Mastery Earth</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Earth 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Burning Woods – Kill Slixin Klex and loot Dirt of underfoot</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Earth 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Firiona Vie – Find Tiblner Milnik and turn in Broom of Trilon (quest item from mage focus item quests), Shovel of Ponz (quest item from mage focus item quests), Staff of Elemental Mastery Earth, and Dirt of underfoot. Receive Element of Earth</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Water 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Kedge Keep – Kill Phinigel Autropos and loot the Staff of Elemental Mastery: Water</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Water 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Overthere – Kill Captain Rottgrime and loot Tears of Erollisi</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Water 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">East Karana – Kill Trabul Earthstrider and loot Rain of Karana</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Water 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Dagnor’s Cauldron – Find Jinalis Andir and turn in the Staff of Elemental Mastery: Water, Tears of Erollisi, and Rain of Karana. Receive Element of Water</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Air 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Plane of Sky –7th Island – Kill anything that moves and loot Crown of Elemental Mastery (Random Drop)</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Air 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Hole – Kill Elemental Warriors and loot an Elemental Binder</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Air 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">South Karana – Kill Quillmane and loot Pegasus Feather Cloak</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Element of Air 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Plane of Air – Find Kihun Solstin, Plane of Air (the quest island) and turn in the Crown of Elemental Mastery, the Elemental Binder, and Pegasus Feather Cloak. Receive Element of Air</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Master of Elements</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Plane of Air – Quest room – Master of Elements will spawn after you turn in items to Kihun Solstin. Turn in: Element of Water, Element of Earth, Element of Fire, Element of Air Receive Orb of Mastery.</td></tr></tbody> </table> 
							
